1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 2=

2
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:17,640
Uncle.

3
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,200
Is Boss Dong really dead?

4
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,600
I heard

5
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,840
we're now under
the Kuang family's illegitimate son.

6
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,360
Is that true?

7
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,720
Funeral contributions
for the former boss,

8
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:35,880
and tribute money for the new one.

9
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,160
How much is that going to cost?

10
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,640
We have to pay a thousand now

11
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,600
and another thousand
at the end of the year.

12
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:41,800
That much?

13
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:43,000
Otherwise,

14
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:44,840
we could take a few hundred
from the pawnshop first.

15
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,760
Demand money from your men today,

16
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,360
and they'll betray you tomorrow.

17
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:51,000
You should know that better than I do.

18
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,560
Then what do you suggest?

19
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:56,680
Find a dozen people who can
each borrow a hundred or two.

20
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,000
Three days later,

21
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:00,280
send someone to wreck all their shops

22
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,080
and force them to repay early.

23
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:03,960
How can we keep doing business
like this?

24
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,760
Don't we still have
Mei Xiaozhu's promissory note?

25
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,960
How's the debt collection going?

26
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:08,960
Have you recovered the money?

27
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:09,800
She's dead.

28
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:12,280
What? You drove her to her death?

29
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,680
I didn't drive her to it.

30
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,360
Her family will have to repay her debt.

31
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:31,170
Boss, this is the Ding residence.

32
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,200
Interesting.

33
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,880
Well, Boss Lv. What an honor.

34
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,240
I hear you're an excellent cook.

35
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:49,720
I've come to try your cooking.

36
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:50,880
Ding Zhao,

37
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,960
prepare a proper meal

38
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,880
for Boss Lv to enjoy.

39
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,800
Boss Lv,

40
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,200
I'll head inside, then.

41
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,320
We weren't expecting guests.

42
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,920
We only have a few dead crabs.

43
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,800
That's no problem.

44
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,280
I've even eaten dead rats.

45
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:06,200
Please have a seat
in the courtyard, Boss Lv.

46
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:07,320
It'll be ready shortly.

47
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:11,480
Just sitting around waiting

48
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,840
would be rather boring.

49
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,800
I've looked through the account books.

50
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:24,080
Yours is the only household
that hasn't paid its tribute.

51
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,240
It's only a thousand yuan.

52
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,240
Why make such a fuss?

53
00:03:28,830 --> 00:03:30,560
This house is divided into two sections.

54
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:32,480
Not many people, and rather frugal,

55
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:34,380
so only the smaller half was rented.

56
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,920
The other half is the Sanshi Club.

57
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,800
The Kuang family uses it to prepare
for the Sanxun Gathering.

58
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:42,800
The people inside do carpentry
from morning till night.

59
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,720
Even the most skilled craftsmen

60
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:47,480
earn only 25 yuan a month.

61
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:50,600
When prices soared a few years ago,

62
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,560
their wages were even lower.

63
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:54,320
By that calculation,

64
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:57,880
a thousand yuan could amount
to several years' wages.

65
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:00,600
You feel sorry for them?

66
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:02,160
What I mean is,

67
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,560
half the money I lent out

68
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:06,030
comes from those 25 yuan wages.

69
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:08,200
I'm their enemy.

70
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:10,570
They have to watch
every yuan of their wages

71
00:04:10,570 --> 00:04:11,680
just to repay me.

72
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,760
And I have to account for
every yuan of that thousand

73
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,160
just to repay you.

74
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:23,840
It seems you're just like me, Mr. Ding.

75
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,840
You care more about your own interests.

76
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:27,520
I watch every little detail

77
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,880
in everything I do.

78
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,880
Fine.

79
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,760
Help me find someone.

80
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,480
Once the job is done,

81
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,440
I'll waive your tribute.

82
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:42,090
Who?

83
00:04:42,930 --> 00:04:44,140
Before Mei Xiaozhu died,

84
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:46,280
she was close to a dance hostess
on Fourth Road.

85
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,800
I want you to find that woman.

86
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,360
Why?

87
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:56,400
I suspect she was my brother-in-law's

88
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,920
secret mistress.

89
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,000
When she failed to become his wife,

90
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,800
she grew bitter

91
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:05,400
and conspired with Mei Xiaozhu
to kill him.

92
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:09,600
Well, you know how it is.

93
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,280
As for me,

94
00:05:11,500 --> 00:05:12,500
I've only just returned
to the Kuang family.

95
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:13,880
I need to accomplish something

96
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:14,880
and show some dedication,

97
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,480
so my father and the Kun Society
can be proud of me.

98
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,040
That's the only way
I can secure my position

99
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:21,520
overseeing the loan sharks, right?

100
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:22,920
Why ask me?

101
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:29,240
Doesn't the Mei family owe you money?

102
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:32,800
We're out in the open,

103
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,320
while that woman is hiding
in the shadows.

104
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,360
We mustn't alert her.

105
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,440
Don't worry.

106
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,840
After all, a thousand yuan is at stake.

107
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,040
I'll give you time to think it over.

108
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:51,300
Young ladies imitate wealthy wives.

109
00:05:51,430 --> 00:05:54,360
They dress up by day
and cry out at night.

110
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,520
In high heels and feathered hats,

111
00:05:57,800 --> 00:06:01,160
they dance onstage in the dead of night.

112
00:06:01,210 --> 00:06:04,060
On the fifteenth night of
the seventh month, the underworld opens.

113
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:07,160
They lure lecherous ghosts
bearing money.

114
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:10,040
With one foot between life and death,

115
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:12,800
a flower in their hair
brings an early grave.

116
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:16,080
Young ladies imitate wealthy wives.

117
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:19,200
They dress up by day
and cry out at night.

118
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:22,360
In high heels and feathered hats,

119
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:25,800
they dance onstage in the dead of night.

120
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:29,000
On the fifteenth night of
the seventh month, the underworld opens.

121
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:31,880
They lure lecherous ghosts
bearing money.

122
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,080
With one foot between life and death,

123
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,040
(Yuhe.)

124
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:36,280
(Xiaozhu.)

125
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:39,560
(I've learned two
fashionable new designs.)

126
00:06:39,980 --> 00:06:41,040
(Let me make you a dress.)

127
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,960
Yuhe, you know

128
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,440
I don't like wearing dresses.

129
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:47,120
Don't waste such fine fabric on me.

130
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:49,840
There are school events
and competitions.

131
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,240
You should have a couple
of nice outfits for those.

132
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,200
I don't want anyone looking down on you.

133
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:57,280
Yuhe, wearing pretty dresses

134
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,360
won't earn us genuine respect.

135
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,120
Yes.

136
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,840
Only knowledge can earn us respect.

137
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:07,240
But I'm still making you one.

138
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:09,240
You'll need it someday.

139
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:10,920
Right?

140
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:33,600
Xiaozhu.

141
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:37,200
What on earth happened?

142
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:40,280
Why did you suddenly want
to wear dresses

143
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:42,320
and start going to places like that?

144
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:43,520
And...

145
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,640
You're back.

146
00:07:58,960 --> 00:07:59,800
Why are you home so late?

147
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:03,520
Didn't you take an umbrella?

148
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:04,800
How did your hair get wet?

149
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:06,120
Where have you been?

150
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:07,200
A classmate's birthday party.

151
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:16,080
Oh, dear.

152
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,640
Dry your hair before going to bed.

153
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,600
You don't want to catch a cold.

154
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:33,520
Yuhe.

155
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,440
Could you cut my hair?

156
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:39,040
Short hair is very fashionable
these days.

157
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:42,160
I've noticed lots of girls

158
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:44,440
on the streets have short hair.

159
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:47,080
Which fashionable actress
are you trying to imitate?

160
00:08:52,780 --> 00:08:53,800
Now that summer vacation is here,

161
00:08:54,100 --> 00:08:54,940
why don't we

162
00:08:55,490 --> 00:08:57,120
go shopping together?

163
00:08:57,740 --> 00:08:59,000
Didn't you say

164
00:08:59,500 --> 00:09:01,030
you wanted a new fountain pen?

165
00:09:01,350 --> 00:09:02,280
I don't have time.

166
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:11,900
Xiaozhu.

167
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:14,740
Whatever you choose to do,

168
00:09:15,420 --> 00:09:17,020
I'll always support you.

169
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:18,940
But if

170
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:21,380
you run into something
you can't handle yourself,

171
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:22,860
you must tell me.

172
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:23,500
All right?

173
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:25,540
Okay.

174
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,260
All right, I'll trim your bangs.

175
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:10,160
Yuhe.

176
00:10:10,850 --> 00:10:12,020
No matter what happens,

177
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:13,380
you'll believe me,

178
00:10:13,390 --> 00:10:14,100
won't you?

179
00:10:29,740 --> 00:10:32,140
(My Body Is the Answer)

180
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:05,500
Yijie.

181
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:08,700
What are you doing?

182
00:11:08,970 --> 00:11:09,660
Mother.

183
00:11:10,220 --> 00:11:11,620
You shouldn't be here.

184
00:11:11,980 --> 00:11:12,540
Go back.

185
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:16,940
I just wanted to see father.

186
00:11:26,660 --> 00:11:28,180
You're all I have now.

187
00:11:29,820 --> 00:11:31,020
You must make something of yourself

188
00:11:31,380 --> 00:11:32,780
and win your grandfather's favor.

189
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:35,620
You must become
the Kuang family's sole heir.

190
00:11:36,100 --> 00:11:36,900
Do you understand?

191
00:11:43,060 --> 00:11:44,020
I understand.

192
00:11:49,460 --> 00:11:50,660
What are you thinking?

193
00:11:51,010 --> 00:11:52,820
You're not really going to agree
to Boss Lv's request, are you?

194
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,180
Getting involved with gangs

195
00:11:57,620 --> 00:11:58,820
never ends well.

196
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:01,540
Has Yiyi been coming home
this late lately?

197
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:04,060
She's at the age
when she enjoys making friends.

198
00:12:05,180 --> 00:12:07,300
(One Yuan)

199
00:12:07,300 --> 00:12:08,140
Get me some hot water.

200
00:12:09,780 --> 00:12:11,100
Get me some hot water.
I want to wash my face.

201
00:12:11,540 --> 00:12:12,900
Why are you home so late?

202
00:12:12,980 --> 00:12:14,020
It's none of your business.

203
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:16,300
Don't be upset.

204
00:12:16,620 --> 00:12:17,420
I'll go get some water.

205
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:18,380
I'll go...

206
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:19,540
Uncle.

207
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:22,060
You keep eating. I'll go.

208
00:12:33,540 --> 00:12:34,820
Just look at yourself.

209
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:37,180
You don't look like a student at all.

210
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:40,140
Where have you been?

211
00:12:40,380 --> 00:12:41,220
It's none of your business.

212
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:43,020
If you weren't my sister,

213
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:44,340
I wouldn't bother with you.

214
00:12:44,940 --> 00:12:45,940
Who wants to be your sister?

215
00:12:46,460 --> 00:12:47,500
You have no money

216
00:12:47,660 --> 00:12:48,860
and no social standing.

217
00:12:50,020 --> 00:12:50,940
What did you say?

218
00:12:52,140 --> 00:12:53,580
I said I don't want to be your sister.

219
00:12:53,820 --> 00:12:55,620
Who even wants to attend
Mintong Middle School?

220
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:57,620
The principal makes it sound
so wonderful.

221
00:12:57,900 --> 00:12:58,700
Everyone is equal.

222
00:12:58,940 --> 00:13:00,140
Where's the equality?

223
00:13:00,620 --> 00:13:02,140
Everyone else's family
either owns a department store

224
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,700
or has someone working
in the government.

225
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:04,780
I'm the only one

226
00:13:04,980 --> 00:13:07,060
whose family is in the lowly
debt collection business.

227
00:13:11,380 --> 00:13:13,020
What's so lowly about collecting debts?

228
00:13:13,620 --> 00:13:14,940
Everything you eat, drink, and use

229
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:17,300
was paid for with money
I earned collecting debts.

230
00:13:17,780 --> 00:13:19,460
Who wants your miserable money?

231
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:20,460
I don't want

232
00:13:20,460 --> 00:13:22,340
anything to do with you at all.

233
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:25,620
Get out. Get out of here!

234
00:13:25,910 --> 00:13:27,620
Get out!

235
00:13:28,460 --> 00:13:29,340
It's all your fault.

236
00:13:29,420 --> 00:13:32,660
The person I like won't
return my feelings because of you.

237
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:34,060
Who do you like?

238
00:13:35,420 --> 00:13:36,300
Go!

239
00:13:47,100 --> 00:13:48,660
Yiyi is still young.

240
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:49,700
She doesn't know any better.

241
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:51,860
Please don't be angry with her.

242
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:56,060
She's grown up.

243
00:13:57,180 --> 00:13:58,140
Where are you going

244
00:13:58,620 --> 00:13:59,500
so late at night?

245
00:14:01,580 --> 00:14:02,260
To collect a debt.

246
00:14:11,940 --> 00:14:14,260
Yuhe, I'm sorry.

247
00:14:14,500 --> 00:14:16,100
I ruined the dress.

248
00:14:16,700 --> 00:14:18,320
It's not the dress I'm worried about.

249
00:14:19,100 --> 00:14:19,820
It's you.

250
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:22,380
You're always climbing around.

251
00:14:22,740 --> 00:14:24,100
What if you hurt yourself one day?

252
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:25,780
I'm sorry.

253
00:14:26,100 --> 00:14:27,100
I made you worry.

254
00:15:20,220 --> 00:15:21,340
Xiaozhu.

255
00:15:22,540 --> 00:15:23,620
All this time,

256
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:26,420
I've been waiting
for you to tell me your secret.

257
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:28,700
But I don't want to wait anymore.

258
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:30,700
And...

259
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:35,140
I can't wait any longer.

260
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:02,100
Forgive me, Xiaozhu.

261
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:12,020
(If this is your final wish,)

262
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:15,260
(if the answer lies within your body,)

263
00:16:16,380 --> 00:16:18,180
(even if everyone condemns me,)

264
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:19,620
(I will...)

265
00:16:21,260 --> 00:16:22,380
(I will...)

266
00:16:23,020 --> 00:16:24,660
(find the answer myself.)

267
00:16:25,180 --> 00:16:29,670
♪Neon lights shimmer across my body♪

268
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:32,910
♪Like diamonds flickering♪

269
00:16:33,060 --> 00:16:36,780
♪Yet glory lies too far away♪

270
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:43,430
♪My high heels tap against the streets
of the old harbor♪

271
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:48,900
Xiaozhu, where are you going?

272
00:16:52,210 --> 00:16:52,980
Xiaozhu.

273
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:56,950
♪They pour a word or two of lies
into their wineglasses♪

274
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:57,670
♪And say to me♪

275
00:16:57,680 --> 00:17:00,630
♪Come on, smile. Don't ask why♪

276
00:17:00,640 --> 00:17:03,070
♪But I can clearly taste the rust♪

277
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:09,030
♪Behind the cold, cloying champagne♪

278
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:12,350
♪I once witnessed demons♪

279
00:17:12,360 --> 00:17:15,710
♪Selling hope amid applause♪

280
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:18,750
♪If this is what they call salvation♪

281
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:19,830
♪Then I would rather choose♪

282
00:17:19,830 --> 00:17:22,110
♪To wake amid pain and blood♪

283
00:17:25,760 --> 00:17:28,590
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

284
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:32,350
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

285
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:35,630
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

286
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:37,230
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

287
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,350
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

288
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:41,110
♪But I refuse to fall♪

289
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:45,950
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

290
00:17:46,140 --> 00:17:48,590
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

291
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:52,760
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

292
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:55,940
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

293
00:17:55,940 --> 00:17:58,000
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

294
00:17:58,020 --> 00:17:59,000
This is...

295
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:02,630
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

296
00:18:04,100 --> 00:18:04,580
(Yuhe.)

297
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:06,460
(No matter what happens,)

298
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:07,820
you'll believe me,

299
00:18:07,820 --> 00:18:08,380
won't you?

300
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,670
♪I choose to pierce through♪

301
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:16,230
♪To tear apart♪

302
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:23,990
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

303
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,950
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

304
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:28,910
♪Nor bow to power♪

305
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,990
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

306
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:36,830
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪

307
00:18:38,250 --> 00:18:40,270
♪The rainy night is long♪

308
00:18:40,270 --> 00:18:42,840
♪And you never came back♪

309
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:49,270
♪A black cat waits silently
by the shuttered window♪

310
00:18:49,280 --> 00:18:53,590
♪Whose wings were broken amid applause♪

311
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:56,910
♪If this is their salvation♪

312
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,750
♪I choose♪

313
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:05,430
♪To ignite the light in another way♪

314
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:08,870
♪A single lamp lights up♪

315
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:12,540
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

316
00:19:12,540 --> 00:19:16,030
♪When all the glitter collapses♪

317
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:18,150
♪The truth remains where it is♪

318
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:23,190
♪And the sun, in the end,♪

319
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:29,790
♪Still rises step by step♪
